<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3060 ;
    djr:text "\n- TDD의 목표는 작동하는 깔끔한 코드다: 두려움 없이 변경할 수 있는 용기가 핵심 (§1.1–§1.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
