    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s040-9.1/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s041-9.2/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3074, djr:R-3075 ;
    djr:text "- Outside-In 이중 루프도 바깥·안쪽 테스트를 자동 의무화하지 않는다. Walking Skeleton은 실제 얇은 E2E 행동이다 (§9.1–§9.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s069-17.4/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3076 ;
    djr:text "- AI 보조 TDD에서 테스트는 명세다: 개발자가 테스트를 작성하고, AI 구현은 테스트를 통과한 후 검증한다 (§17.1–§17.4)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3061 ;
    djr:text "- Red-Green-Refactor 순서를 지켜라: 실패하는 테스트 먼저, 통과 후에만 리팩토링 (§2.1)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s012-3.4/b7> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3062 ;
    djr:text "- 고전 학파(상태 검증)를 기본으로, 협력 구조 설계가 목적일 때만 런던 학파(행위 검증)를 선택한다 (§3.1–§3.4)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3063 ;
    djr:text "- 좋은 테스트의 4대 기둥: 회귀 방지, 리팩토링 내성, 빠른 피드백, 유지 보수성 — 리팩토링 내성은 타협하지 않는다 (§4.1–§4.4)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b17>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3064, djr:R-3065 ;
    djr:text "- 테스트 목록은 후보일 뿐이다. 모든 영구 test artifact의 add/update/move/split/rename/remove/weaken·재조직 전에 §5.5 입장 심사를 거치며, 의미 보존 재조직은 새 case·Red 없이 전후 보호가 같아야 한다 (§5.1–§5.3)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b17>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b34>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b5>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b6>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b7> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3066, djr:R-3067, djr:R-3068 ;
    djr:text "- 영구 테스트는 승인된 현행 계약·독자 실패·기존 권위 coverage를 판정한다. 공개 Python 계약은 별도 사용자 승인 또는 deployed consumer evidence 중 하나로 자격을 얻는다. `pending`은 G1을 막고 `reuse`·`reject`는 test artifact write가 0이다 (§5.5)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b37>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b46> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3069, djr:R-3070 ;
    djr:text "- migration 전용 테스트는 만들지 않고 기존 것도 삭제한다(절대 규칙 — `migrations/`는 생성물·`check-test-config` #637). 과거 버그에서 태어났어도 현행 계약을 검증하는 회귀 테스트는 보존한다 (§5.5)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s028-6.2/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s029-6.3/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3071 ;
    djr:text "- 초록 막대 전략: 가짜로 구현하기 → 삼각측량 → 명백한 구현 순으로 진행 (§6.1–§6.3)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s031-7.1/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s032-7.2/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3072 ;
    djr:text "- 테스트는 격리하고, AAA 패턴으로 구조화하라: Arrange-Act-Assert (§7.1–§7.2)\n"@ko .

